            "body": "Adjusting that in 'mini.extra' itself should straightforward, but I am afraid I can not reproduce. I tried both `LuaLS` and `gopls`, and both result in relative paths shown in both `:Pick buffers` and `:buffers`.\r\n\r\nWould you mind, please, provide an exact steps to reproduce this? Including LSP server (I assume, `gopls`?), repo (some already existing public repo or dummy one created by you specifically for this), and exact file-position pair at which `:Pick lsp scope='definition'` is executed.",
