                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Repo : <a href=\"https://github.com/harg/gomini\">https://github.com/harg/gomini</a><br>\nLSP server : gopls v0.17.1<br>\nOS: Windows 10<br>\nNvim : tested with latest stable or the pre-release</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">:Pick lsp scope='definition'</code>  on main.go l: 6, c:14</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/34398/400408337-5844c3c3-b0e9-4016-b0f6-e8547bbbcdcc.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..2A3jxEms0we-KwFGP3IZSYbXUT2nXdMI2areKFuCzQw\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/34398/400408337-5844c3c3-b0e9-4016-b0f6-e8547bbbcdcc.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..2A3jxEms0we-KwFGP3IZSYbXUT2nXdMI2areKFuCzQw\" alt=\"image\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">:Pick buffers</code> :</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/34398/400408787-3ec05ece-ee3e-43b5-addd-e997aa97fc91.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..YdfjUE-5QIDpmnxgWXXBATzipHjucqSZ7C95xNBuHAw\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/34398/400408787-3ec05ece-ee3e-43b5-addd-e997aa97fc91.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..YdfjUE-5QIDpmnxgWXXBATzipHjucqSZ7C95xNBuHAw\" alt=\"image\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If I run again <code class=\"notranslate\">:cd c:\\CODE\\gomini</code>, it displays the relative path :</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/34398/400409338-15d5d8f4-1bfa-4b78-b09e-28e2cba81dcf.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..PfFkAUq7VPnVlfgDcyqu-6rPmkTA8EHhyzJjusamC5U\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/34398/400409338-15d5d8f4-1bfa-4b78-b09e-28e2cba81dcf.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOi