                {
                    "author": {
                        "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34398?u=e066d3aa7c6c61d0547e092ccc88da8acd2408fe&v=4",
                        "login": "harg",
                        "resourcePath": "/harg",
                        "url": "https://github.com/harg"
                    },
                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Indeed, last night i ended up with this : \r\n\r\n```lua\r\n-- UGLY WORKAUROUND : reapply the working directory on file/buffer enter in order to set relative filepath in buffer list\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd({ \"BufEnter\", \"BufWinEnter\" }, {\r\n  pattern = \"*\",\r\n  callback = function()\r\n    local initial_cwd = vim.fn.getcwd()\r\n    vim.cmd(\"silent cd \" .. initial_cwd)\r\n  end,\r\n})\r\n```\r\n",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Indeed, last night i ended up with this :</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"-- UGLY WORKAUROUND : reapply the working directory on file/buffer enter in order to set relative filepath in buffer list\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd({ &quot;BufEnter&quot;, &quot;BufWinEnter&quot; }, {\n  pattern = &quot;*&quot;,\n  callback = function()\n    local initial_cwd = vim.fn.getcwd()\n    vim.cmd(&quot;silent cd &quot; .. initial_cwd)\n  end,\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> UGLY WORKAUROUND : reapply the working directory on file/buffer enter in order to set relative filepath in buffer list</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">api</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">nvim_create_autocmd</span>({ <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>BufEnter<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>BufWinEnter<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>}, {\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>*<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n  <span class=\"pl-en\">callback</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>()\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">initial_cwd</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">getcwd</span>()\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">cmd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>silent cd <span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">..</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">initial_cwd</span>)\n  <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>,\n})</pre></div>",
                    "bodyText": "Indeed, last night i ended up with this :\n-- UGLY WORKAUROUND : reapply the working directory on file/buffer enter in order to set relative filepath in buffer list\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd({ \"BufEnter\", \"BufWinEnter\" }, {\n  pattern = \"*\",\n  callback = function()\n    local initial_cwd = vim.fn.getcwd()\n    vim.cmd(\"silent cd \" .. initial_cwd)\n  end,\n})",
